+**Parameters:**
+*   $\lambda_s$: Initial weight for coarse-to-fine optimization, set to 0.9 [S1].
+*   $\lambda_e$: Final weight for coarse-to-fine optimization, set to 0.1 [S1].
+*   $k$: Hyper-parameter controlling the number of rigid camera motions in the RBK. Output channel dimensions for $m_s, r_s, v_s$ are $k, 3k, 3k$ respectively [S1].
+*   $N_c, N_f$: Number of coarse and fine samples, set to 64 each [S1].
+*   Learning Rate: Exponentially decays from $5 \times 10^{-4}$ to $8 \times 10^{-5}$ [S1].
+*   Optimizer: Adam with default parameters [S1].
+*   Image Resolution: Resized to $600 \times 400$ [S1].
+*   Total Iterations: 200,000 [S1].
+*   RBK Training Start: After 1200 iterations of pure NeRF training [S1].
